## Collecting All Values of $s$

The distinct values of $s$ are: $\{25, 27, 31, 37, 40, 45, 46, 55, 61, 81, 100, 136\}$ — all 12 are distinct.

$$\text{Sum} = 25+27+31+37+40+45+46+55+61+81+100+136$$

